Step files for each part are located in their individual folders. .3mf files are located in the folder, 3DPrint_Slicer_Files, as well as the individual folders.

Multi Angle Main Arm print files and filament type:
  MAA_MainArm.3mf (ABS-GF)
  MAA_Modifier_MainArm.3mf (Loaded as modifier in MAA_MainArm.3mf. 100% infill)
  MAA_Pulleys.3mf (ABS)
  
Drilling Frame:
  DrillFrame.3mf (ABS-GF)

UCF:
  MAA_UCF.3mf (ABS-GF)
  CutterHeads_Nuts.3mf (ABS)
  CutterHeads_Plain.3mf (ABS)
  CutterHead_Round.3mf (ABS)
  
Cutter heads should be printed with a 0.08mm layer height.  The others may be printed with a 0.2mm layer height (0.08mm layer height is OK, but will take much longer to print).

Insert cutter heads have CW and CCW versions. The round cutter head uses 0.125" engraving bits and can be configured for either CW or CCW.
